      "name": "The Eternal Horse x Marina IFC",
      "client": {
        "link_type": "Document"
      },
      "description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The project aims to become a signature experience during the Lunar New Year where technology Vietnamese culture and contemporary art come together to form an engaging space for the community.",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
      ],
      "detail_description": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Commissioned by Saigon Marina IFC and affiliates, we developed the full visual world for 8 Collective’s installations — bringing together 7 artists to reinterpret the White Horse as a symbol of movement between past and future for the year of the Horse. \nContributing artists: Collaborating with Long Đoàn, Zetsk and Thông Đinh, Trần Thanh Vy, Overthinker, Tâm Bùi and callmeBu\n",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "",
          "spans": [],
          "direction": "ltr"
        }
